{"3698200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SoulGatherer", "steam_appid": 3698200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fallen guardian returns to a shattered world, where souls cry out and fragments decide fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Gatherer</strong> is a dark 3D action roguelite that challenges you to reclaim a ruined world, one soul fragment at a time.<br><br>Engage in fast-paced real-time combat as you choose your weapon before each run — whether it's a swift blade or a heavy-hitting greatsword. Every weapon offers a distinct approach to combat, letting you shape your playstyle through timing, movement, and skill execution.<br><br>Defeat elite enemies and bosses to obtain fragments — remnants of powerful beings lost to chaos. Some fragments enhance your strength, while others hold memories that slowly unveil the story of a world broken by ambition and betrayal.<br><br>You are the spirit of a once-great protector, guided by a mysterious entity known as the Timekeeper. Travel through four cursed domains — each ruled by a tormented being consumed by their past. Learn the truth behind the world's collapse and face the soul that shares your blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather what remains. Defy what’s broken. And decide what comes next.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fallen guardian returns to a shattered world, where souls cry out and fragments decide fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Gatherer</strong> is a dark 3D action roguelite that challenges you to reclaim a ruined world, one soul fragment at a time.<br><br>Engage in fast-paced real-time combat as you choose your weapon before each run — whether it's a swift blade or a heavy-hitting greatsword. Every weapon offers a distinct approach to combat, letting you shape your playstyle through timing, movement, and skill execution.<br><br>Defeat elite enemies and bosses to obtain fragments — remnants of powerful beings lost to chaos. Some fragments enhance your strength, while others hold memories that slowly unveil the story of a world broken by ambition and betrayal.<br><br>You are the spirit of a once-great protector, guided by a mysterious entity known as the Timekeeper. Travel through four cursed domains — each ruled by a tormented being consumed by their past. Learn the truth behind the world's collapse and face the soul that shares your blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather what remains. Defy what’s broken. And decide what comes next.</strong></p>", "short_description": "One world. One soul. Countless fragments.", "supported_languages": "Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698200/65317a4dacf1778e0cd67a19a70a10b48b4c8f7e/header.jpg?t=1748392294", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698200/1e92fda0bdd300695b4d76194356e19ad80a2c14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748392294", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698200/1e92fda0bdd300695b4d76194356e19ad80a2c14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748392294", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> </li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", 